{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"wudi-e-o058a","title":"曹操取彭城并进攻下邳","accounts":[{"id":"wudi-e-o058a-account","label":"正文","text":"曹操屠彭城、获侯谐，进下邳击破吕布骑兵，获成廉；吕布求降被陈宫等劝阻。","evidence":["wudi-e-o058a-q"]},{"id":"chengguo-a-a865c91369bd66656cc7","label":"正文","text":"曹操征吕布三战破之布退固守","evidence":["chengguo-q-f18c4a85b7e257aa918e"]},{"id":"lvzang-a-3d62d0541134543cb4d8","label":"正文","text":"太祖自征布遗布书陈祸福布欲降宫等沮之","evidence":["lvzang-q-1833285c8d232cb8a9f0"]},{"id":"lvzang-a-f68e6101d0c41d04dbb1","label":"正文","text":"布求救于袁术自将出战败走还保城术不能救","evidence":["lvzang-q-ad37f7e24876bbfcba6c"]}],"participants":[{"person":"cao-cao","role":"攻城","evidence":["wudi-e-o058a-q"]},{"person":"wudi-p0088","role":"战败欲降","evidence":["wudi-e-o058a-q"]},{"person":"wudi-p0141","role":"被获","evidence":["wudi-e-o058a-q"]},{"person":"wudi-p0142","role":"被获","evidence":["wudi-e-o058a-q"]},{"person":"wudi-p0096","role":"劝阻降议","evidence":["wudi-e-o058a-q"]},{"person":"wudi-p0057","role":"求援对象","evidence":["wudi-e-o058a-q"]}],"place":{"text":"彭城、下邳","evidence":["wudi-e-o058a-q"]},"time":{"label":"建安三年冬十月","year":198,"precision":"year","basis":"纪年经本批逐段审定；年份依据见所引原文纪年与现代注释。","evidence":["wudi-e-o058a-q","wudi-q-o054","wudi-q-b-4269a9733b31c7ed1578"],"chronology":"wudi-y198","dating_review":{"anchor":"wudi-q-o054","basis":"建安三年冬十月","reviewed":true}},"source_order":[1,339,"O058a"],"order":149}],"persons":[{"id":"cao-cao","name":"曹操","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"wudi-p0057","name":"袁术","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"wudi-p0088","name":"吕布","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"wudi-p0096","name":"陈宫","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"wudi-p0141","name":"侯谐","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"wudi-p0142","name":"成廉","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"chengguo-q-f18c4a85b7e257aa918e","section":"chapter-014","block":"b-69c6201f45456edc20df","layer":"original","quote":"征吕布，三战，破之；布退，固守。","section_title":"程郭董刘蒋刘传第十四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0033.xhtml","index":109,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":16,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"lvzang-q-1833285c8d232cb8a9f0","section":"chapter-007","block":"b-d86e39197497f88256bb","layer":"original","quote":"太祖自征布。至其城下，遗布书，为陈祸福〖2〗。布欲降，陈宫等自以负罪深，沮其计","section_title":"吕布张邈臧洪传第七","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0019.xhtml","index":97,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":39,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"lvzang-q-ad37f7e24876bbfcba6c","section":"chapter-007","block":"b-d86e39197497f88256bb","layer":"original","quote":"布遣人求救于（术术）〔袁术〕；自将千余骑出战，败。走还保城，不敢出","section_title":"吕布张邈臧洪传第七","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0019.xhtml","index":97,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":43,"end":76,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wudi-e-o058a-q","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-1e667d99069ce89fe4e0","layer":"original","quote":"冬十月，屠彭城〖2〗，获其相侯谐。进至下邳，布自将骑逆击〖3〗。大破之，获其骁将成廉，追至城下。布恐，欲降。陈宫等沮其计〖4〗，求救于术，劝布出战。战又败，乃还固守；","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":338,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":83,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wudi-q-b-4269a9733b31c7ed1578","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-4269a9733b31c7ed1578","layer":"modern","quote":"〖1〗三年：建安三年（公元 198）。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":327,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-1273453201e8129c485c","start":0,"end":19,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wudi-q-o054","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-ec1ae0750950ac5532fb","layer":"original","quote":"三年春正月〖1〗，公还许。初置军师祭酒〖2〗。三月，公围张绣于穰。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":323,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":33,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
